isibility and create a supportive network around your music, which could lead to exciting collaborations and new projects.\n\nInformation needed:\n[{\"description\": \"How can I find a more fulfilling way to express my love for music?\", \"id\": \"answer\", \"time_scope\": null}, {\"description\": \"What are my past experiences with music that I found fulfilling?\", \"id\": \"subtask_past_music_experiences\", \"time_scope\": null}]"
